/*
	[1] Object Role
	 |
	 |  This object is the parent of all ragdoll segments, used to uniformly execute the same
	 |  general events they share.
	 |  You can read more information about Gamemaker's parenting function within the manual.
	 |  
	 |  !NOTE: Each child instance of this object has a variable called 'parent' inside,
	 |  which is actually pointing to their spawner instance 'o_ragSpawner'.
	 |  
	[-]
*/